{"type":"Film","id":"FR2015_112","slug":"fr2015-112-je-lutte-donc-je-suis","title":{"native":"Je lutte donc je suis","english":""},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2015-09-11","year":2015},"filmType":"Documentary","directors":[{"id":"Yannis Youlountas","slug":"yannis-youlountas","name":"Yannis Youlountas","birthYear":1970,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Greece","awards":[]}],"genre":["Documentary – Expository mode","Documentary – Participatory mode"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://fr.web.img2.acsta.net/c_310_420/pictures/15/09/09/17/56/324158.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p9tMjHBHbYo"},"synopsis":{"native":"De Grèce et d’Espagne, un vent du sud sur l’Europe, contre la résignation. Dans les villes et les campagnes, dans les îles et les montagnes, au cœur des luttes et des alternatives en actes, des femmes, des hommes, mais aussi des enfants refusent de baisser les bras. Une même devise résume leur courage de résister, leur joie de créer et leur persévérance à toute épreuve : \"JE LUTTE DONC JE SUIS\" (prononcer \"AGONIZOMAI ARA IPARKO\" en grec et \"LUCHO LUEGO EXISTO\" en espagnol). Quelques mots pour vivre debout, parce que rester assis, c’est se mettre à genoux. Une brise marine, souriante et solidaire, de Barcelone à Athènes et d’Andalousie en Crète, qui repousse les nuages du pessimisme. Un voyage palpitant en musique, d’un bout à l’autre de la Méditerranée, en terres de luttes et d’utopie.","english":""},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Angélique Ionatos","slug":"angelique-ionatos","name":"Angélique Ionatos","birthYear":1954,"deathYear":2021,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Diego Cañamero Valle","slug":"diego-canamero-valle","name":"Diego Cañamero Valle","birthYear":1957,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Juan Manuel Sánchez Gordillo","slug":"juan-manuel-sanchez-gordillo","name":"Juan Manuel Sánchez Gordillo","birthYear":1949,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Yannis Youlountas","slug":"yannis-youlountas","name":"Yannis Youlountas","birthYear":1970,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Greece","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Éric Toussaint","slug":"eric-toussaint","name":"Éric Toussaint","birthYear":1954,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Belgium","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"}],"awards":[],"tags":["activism","artistic creation"]}